{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"荔枝角工廈單位火警　一人不適送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FIRE-CSW-261120-13.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】荔枝角有工廈單位起火，一人吸入濃煙不適送院。</p><p>消防架起雲梯開喉灌救。早上10時許，警方接獲多人報案指，青山道嘉名工廠大廈7樓一個單位平台有雜物起火，消防接報派出煙帽隊到場撲救，約半小時後將火救熄。期間約50人疏散到樓下，起火原因有待調查。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:03:58.670969+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:30:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.821758+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T05:57:31.146091+00:00","content_hash":"eaf1c8914f7642d7fa53fad495bf5aa9dd670d2913e3486060fecaec24b37405","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:03:58.670969+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}